{"id":"cb46b7dc65d1aa55","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-smullyan-r-prime-equivalence.md","title":"Exercise 8: The Weaker Initial-Segment Scheme Still Yields R","display":"thm-smullyan-r-prime-equivalence — Exercise 8: The Weaker Initial-Segment Scheme Still Yields R","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-smullyan-r-prime-equivalence","aliases":["92-thm-smullyan-r-prime-equivalence"],"display":"thm-smullyan-r-prime-equivalence — Exercise 8: The Weaker Initial-Segment Scheme Still Yields R","source":"第 V 章 p. 71，Exercise 8（PDF 88）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-weak-systems]]","[[92-df-provable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-smullyan-r-prime-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-smullyan-r-prime-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-smullyan-r-prime-equivalence — Exercise 8: The Weaker Initial-Segment Scheme Still Yields R"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 p. 71，Exercise 8（PDF 88）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8ee662ea7161b3d7\" href=\"?note=8ee662ea7161b3d7\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-weak-systems\">92-df-smullyan-weak-systems</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A},\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J_A},\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A},\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J_A},\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J_A}\\)</span> 为原书无指数逻辑公理和规则，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"920841c1841d30c3\" href=\"?note=920841c1841d30c3\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems\">92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_i,R_A\">\\(\\Omega_i,R_A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8ee662ea7161b3d7\" href=\"?note=8ee662ea7161b3d7\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-weak-systems\">92-df-smullyan-weak-systems</a>；所有连接词都按原书展开。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega&#39;_4,\\mathrm{Ax}_{R&#39;},R&#39;_A\">\\(\\Omega&#39;_4,\\mathrm{Ax}_{R&#39;},R&#39;_A\\)</span> 为下列定义目标；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_n=\\nu_n^E\">\\(\\nu_n=\\nu_n^E\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}r\\text{-}prime\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Omega&#39;_4&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(v_1\\leq\\nu_n)\\supset\\bigvee_{i=0}^{n}(v_1=\\nu_i):n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{R&#39;}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\Omega_1\\cup\\Omega_2\\cup\\Omega_3\\cup\\Omega&#39;_4\\cup\\Omega_5,\\\\\nR&#39;_A&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_E,\\mathrm{Ax}_{R&#39;},\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J_A}),\\\\\n\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_A\\quad &amp;(R_A\\vdash F\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ R&#39;_A\\vdash F).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}r\\text{-}prime\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Omega&#39;_4&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(v_1\\leq\\nu_n)\\supset\\bigvee_{i=0}^{n}(v_1=\\nu_i):n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{R&#39;}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\Omega_1\\cup\\Omega_2\\cup\\Omega_3\\cup\\Omega&#39;_4\\cup\\Omega_5,\\\\\nR&#39;_A&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_E,\\mathrm{Ax}_{R&#39;},\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J_A}),\\\\\n\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_A\\quad &amp;(R_A\\vdash F\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ R&#39;_A\\vdash F).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>R 证明 Ω₄ 的一方向，故所有 R′ 公理在 R 中可证。反方向：固定 i&lt;n，Ω′₄ 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_n\\leq\\nu_i\">\\(\\nu_n\\leq\\nu_i\\)</span> 蕴涵 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_n=\\nu_0\\lor\\cdots\\lor\\nu_n=\\nu_i\">\\(\\nu_n=\\nu_0\\lor\\cdots\\lor\\nu_n=\\nu_i\\)</span>；Ω₃ 反驳各项，故 R′ 反驳 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_n\\leq\\nu_i\">\\(\\nu_n\\leq\\nu_i\\)</span>。Ω₅ 的比较析取再推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_i\\leq\\nu_n\">\\(\\nu_i\\leq\\nu_n\\)</span>。当 i=n，Ω₅ 直接给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_n\\leq\\nu_n\">\\(\\nu_n\\leq\\nu_n\\)</span>。对每个 i≤n 用等式代换得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1=\\nu_i\\supset v_1\\leq\\nu_n\">\\(v_1=\\nu_i\\supset v_1\\leq\\nu_n\\)</span>，有限命题逻辑组合为 Ω₄ 所缺的方向。这样每个 R 公理在 R′ 中可证，替换公理的有限证明即得结论。</p>\n<p>这一论证实际使用 Ω₅；不能删去比较模式后原样宣称 R₀ 的单向模式也足够。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-weak-systems","status":"resolved","id":"8ee662ea7161b3d7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-weak-systems]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems","status":"resolved","id":"920841c1841d30c3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A},\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J_A},\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J_A}$ 为原书无指数逻辑公理和规则，见 [[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]]。","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-weak-systems","status":"resolved","id":"8ee662ea7161b3d7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Omega_i,R_A$ 见 [[92-df-smullyan-weak-systems]]；所有连接词都按原书展开。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A},\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J_A},\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_i,R_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega'_4,\\mathrm{Ax}_{R'},R'_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu_n=\\nu_n^E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}r\\text{-}prime\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Omega'_4&\\coloneqq\\{(v_1\\leq\\nu_n)\\supset\\bigvee_{i=0}^{n}(v_1=\\nu_i):n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{R'}&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\Omega_1\\cup\\Omega_2\\cup\\Omega_3\\cup\\Omega'_4\\cup\\Omega_5,\\\\\nR'_A&\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_E,\\mathrm{Ax}_{R'},\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J_A}),\\\\\n\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_A\\quad &(R_A\\vdash F\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ R'_A\\vdash F).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\nu_n\\leq\\nu_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu_n=\\nu_0\\lor\\cdots\\lor\\nu_n=\\nu_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu_n\\leq\\nu_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu_i\\leq\\nu_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu_n\\leq\\nu_n","display":false},{"tex":"v_1=\\nu_i\\supset v_1\\leq\\nu_n","display":false}],"bytes":2048,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书弱系统：[[92-df-smullyan-weak-systems]] → [[92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-weak-subsystems]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-weak-sigma0-completeness]] → [[92-cor-smullyan-weak-sigma1-completeness]]。[[92-thm-smullyan-r-prime-equivalence]]完成练习8，说明比较模式 Ω₅ 的实际用途。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-r-prime-equivalence]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-315","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-r-prime-equivalence]]"}],"outgoing":["8ee662ea7161b3d7","51c43e0240787ebb","920841c1841d30c3"]}